A bang or a Unicode symbol standing in for "not" or a logic operator.
-- hit/agent-compact --
Merge driver alone !enough.
Cache hit ≠ pass.
¬cached -> rerun.
dirty ∧ staged -> commit.
-- pass/agent-compact --
Merge driver alone not enough.
Cache hit is not pass.
Run `!true`.
Done!
